#: includes/doroto-frontend-pages.php:657
msgid "Your Display Name and tournament results will be visible to other users, subject to the visibility settings configured by the website administrator and the tournament organizer."
msgstr "Vaše zobrazované meno a výsledky turnajov budú viditeľné pre ostatných používateľov podľa nastavení viditeľnosti, ktoré určil správca webu a organizátor turnaja."

#: includes/doroto-frontend-pages.php:655
msgid "You are responsible for the content you post, including your Display Name and any match results you submit. By participating in a tournament, you acknowledge and agree that:"
